This talk aims to demystify prototypes and explain their essential role in JavaScript''s object model. We will explore how the prototype chain works with a diagram, the nuances of inheritance in a prototype-based language, and how prototypes empower JavaScript objects to share properties and methods.
Through engaging examples and real-world scenarios, we''ll explore key concepts like __proto__, the prototype property, constructor functions, and the modern alternative to ES6 classes. 

By the end, you’ll leave with a clear understanding of how to harness the power of prototypes in your projects, making you a more efficient and confident JavaScript developer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Web', 'Web', 'Intermediate', NULL, NULL, 'Founder & Executive', NULL, NULL, 15);

In this talk, we’ll explore why Flutter is the ideal framework for startups, focusing on how it accelerates product development while maintaining flexibility and scalability. You’ll learn how to leverage Flutter to build Minimum Viable Products (MVPs) quickly, adapt to market changes, and scale seamlessly as your user base grows.

Through real-world examples, I’ll demonstrate how startups can go from idea to market faster, reduce development costs, and future-proof their apps for success. Whether you’re a founder or a developer working at a startup, this session will equip you with the insights and tools needed to launch and grow your product with Flutter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mobile & Flutter', 'Mobile', 'Intermediate', NULL, NULL, 'Founder & Executive', NULL, NULL, 14);

