"text":"Enter each attendee’s full name, email, mobile number and LinkedIn URL. Give accurate student or professional details. Organizers may check your information and ID; false or unverifiable details may lead to cancellation or denied entry."}]},{"id":"entry","title":"At check-in","policies":[{"id":"entry-identification","title":"Bring your ticket and photo ID","text":"Bring your digital QR ticket and an original physical government-issued photo ID matching your registration name for check-in and badge collection."}]},{"id":"eligibility","title":"Choose the right pass","policies":[{"id":"cadet-id","title":"Cadet: two IDs required","text":"Cadet is for currently enrolled college and university students. Bring your **government photo ID** and **original student ID** matching your registration. Without valid proof, entry may be denied without refund or an upgrade fee may apply. Professionals booking Cadet may face cancellation or need to pay for a Commander upgrade.","appliesTo":["student"]},{"id":"vip-code","title":"Flight Deck: invitation only","text":"Book Cadet or Commander before expressing interest in Flight Deck. Invitations are limited and not guaranteed. Follow the registration instructions in your invitation; expressing interest is not a confirmed registration.","appliesTo":["vip"]}]},{"id":"workshops","title":"Workshops & inclusions","policies":[{"id":"workshop-access","title":"Workshop seats are limited","text":"Your pass must include workshop access. Seats depend on capacity and any session-specific registration requirements. A conference ticket does not reserve a workshop seat."},{"id":"pass-inclusions","title":"What your pass includes","text":"Access, meals, refreshments and DevFest Goodies depend on your selected pass. Any first-come, first-served or while-supplies-last condition applies only where stated for that pass."}]},{"id":"ticket-policy","title":"Ticket policy","policies":[{"id":"final-sale","title":"All sales are final","text":"Tickets cannot be cancelled, transferred, resold, rescheduled or refunded."}]},{"id":"support","title":"Corrections, conduct & support","policies":[{"id":"registration-corrections","title":"Need to correct your details?","text":"Contact the organizers before the event. Corrections cannot transfer a ticket or change the attendee’s identity."},{"id":"community-conduct","title":"Respect the community","text":"Everyone must follow the code of conduct and organizer instructions. Harassment, disruptive behaviour or other violations may result in a revoked pass or removal without refund."}]}]', '[{"title":"Add your LinkedIn URL","text":"Sign in to KonfHub and add your own LinkedIn profile URL before booking."}]', 'I confirm that my attendee details and pass eligibility are accurate. I agree to the registration guidelines and code of conduct. Tickets cannot be cancelled, transferred, resold, rescheduled or refunded.', 'https://konfhub.com/gdg-devfest-indore-2026', 'https://konfhub.com/widget/id/0278dd0b-f629-408a-9a47-9fb249bde1cc', 1, NULL, 0);
